WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.774
Module 9 expands from individual text and time
transformations to broader data-cleaning workflows

00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:13.352
You will use SQL to identify missing values
standardize inconsistent data validate rules and

00:00:13.378 --> 00:00:19.147
address duplicate records The ideas from Module 8
remain important because

00:00:19.161 --> 00:00:26.056
many cleaning tasks depend on correct text
normalization and temporal interpretation Before

00:00:26.069 --> 00:00:30.714
moving on make sure you can explain what each
transformation changes and what meaning it

00:00:30.727 --> 00:00:31.359
preserves
